      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLY'S FOLLY (1) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing second and beaten 0.8 lengths (18.65) behind Bogan Whiskey at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to feature in the finish again. GLASS EFFECTS (5) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (18.82) at this track in a Grade 5. Lines up from box 5 for the first time. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from six starts. Deserves a win and gets her chance. TRALEE RHONDA (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (20.43) in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Better than last start and can bounce back. RED ROCK BLOOM (7) picked up a cheque when public elect last time - in the mix again.",
